Durable if-condition-then rules over vault files.  Triggers: file save
and elapsed schedule; conditions read drawers/tags in the current
buffer; actions reuse the standard primitives (drawer writes,
inline tags, function calls).  Rules persist as data; the engine only
interprets them.  Empty rule set = total no-op.  Nothing here runs at
load except hook/timer registration.

